&lt;li&gt;Drive Design for Manufacture (DFM) for carbon-fiber composites, CNC machined aluminum, injection-molded plastics, and 3D printing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead structural qualification tests (static load, drop testing, vibration per MIL-STD-810H).&lt;/li&gt;
