&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in parametric 3D CAD (SolidWorks, CATIA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in composite design/manufacturing (prepreg, wet layup, bladder molding, sandwich panels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in FEA tools (Ansys, Nastran, or SolidWorks Simulation) and GD&amp;amp;T per ASME Y14.5 / ISO 1101.&lt;/li&gt;
