&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact National Security Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Be part of an ambitious mission to launch the world’s first commercial thermal infrared constellation, delivering sovereign-grade &quot;behavioural&quot; intelligence from space to close critical blind spots for defence, intelligence, and maritime surveillance agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
