&lt;p&gt;Explorer (Level 1) — Uses AI daily to boost personal productivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builder (Level 2) — Creates workflows and tools that elevate the whole team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrator (Level 3) — Embeds AI into products and processes at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every hire must demonstrate at least Level 1. The expected level will vary depending on the seniority of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director Growth Marketing you own B2C patient acquisition for Kaia in Germany end to end – from first impression to activated patient. You set the channel mix (performance, TV/CTV, CRM, SEO, partnerships), own the budget and are accountable for patient volume and CAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the team and agency setup from scratch, use Sword&#39;s global growth playbook and report to the Managing Director Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own B2C growth targets for Germany: sign-ups, activated patients, CAC and payback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and allocate the German B2C marketing budget across channels based on incrementality, not last click&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale paid performance (Meta, Google, YouTube, TikTok, programmatic) incl. high-velocity creative testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead brand and TV/CTV strategy, incl. testimonial and brand ambassador campaigns – test before scaling nationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build full-funnel measurement together with Operations: attribution, MMM, incrementality tests, tracking from sign-up to activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own website/landing page conversion (CRO) and CRM lifecycle journeys (email, SMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and lead an in-house team and manage agencies; align with Sword global marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5+ years in B2C growth/performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owned 6 to 7-figure+ annual budgets with accountability for CAC and payback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills: attribution, incrementality testing, experimentation design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience combining brand/TV/CTV with performance marketing; strong creative judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated category (DiGA, health, OTC pharma, insurance, fintech) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Digital Health experience, 0→1 market launches, marketing to a 45+ target group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
